# HEAVEN SCA benchmark corpus — PATCHED Python pins (precision / negative control).
#
# These are versions that FIXED the specific advisories the vulnerable manifest
# carries. The scorer asserts that none of the curated must-find CVEs are
# reported for these versions — proving HEAVEN respects OSV's fixed ranges and
# never flags a patched dependency for a vulnerability it already resolved. (A
# patched version may still carry *later, unrelated* advisories; that is correct
# and is not what this control checks.)
